# One pattern per line (name/ for a folder, *.ext for a file pattern, dir/sub/ from the root).
# Paths listed here are not catalogued, not searched, not embedded, and never leave this computer.
# Add the folder of any client whose material is confidential or special-category the day it arrives.
_secrets/
credentials/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
